    "text": "Soil water was the original headline: a 26-year global decline. Paradox Earth's own checks showed it is mostly two level shifts that follow documented changes in the radiation data driving the GLDAS model (a step in 2010-08 and a degraded period from 2024-07; GES DISC README_GLDAS2). Within the single consistent period 2012-01 to 2024-06 the global decline is not significant, so the trend was withdrawn and soil water is analysed only inside that window."
  },
